---

---

<section id="blog" class="featured-blog">
    <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recent Thoughts</h2>
        <div class="header-line"></div>
        <a href="/blog" class="view-all">View All</a>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-grid">
        <!-- Blog Post 1 -->
        <article class="blog-card">
            <div class="date">Dec 28, 2025</div>
            <h3><a href="#">The Geometry of CSS Grid</a></h3>
            <p>
                Exploring how mathematical constraints can lead to more creative
                web layouts. Why limitations are better than infinite freedom.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span>#CSS</span>
                <span>#Design</span>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Blog Post 2 -->
        <article class="blog-card">
            <div class="date">Nov 15, 2025</div>
            <h3><a href="#">State Management vs. State Machines</a></h3>
            <p>
                Why thinking in finite states eliminates 90% of your frontend
                bugs. A practical guide to XState with React.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span>#React</span>
                <span>#Architecture</span>
            </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Blog Post 3 -->
        <article class="blog-card">
            <div class="date">Oct 02, 2025</div>
            <h3><a href="#">Performance Patterns in Astro</a></h3>
            <p>
                How the islands architecture changes the way we think about
                shipping JavaScript. My experience migrating a large Next.js
                app.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span>#Astro</span>
                <span>#Performance</span>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .featured-blog {
        padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    }

    .section-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: var(--spacing-md);
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .header-line {
        height: 1px;
        flex: 1;
        background: var(--color-border);
    }

    .view-all {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-accent);
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .blog-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .blog-card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        height: 100%;
        padding: var(--spacing-md);
        border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .blog-card:hover {
        border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .date {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    }

    h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    }

    h3 a:hover {
        color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        flex: 1;
    }

    .tags {
        display: flex;
        gap: var(--spacing-sm);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        opacity: 0.8;
    }
</style>
